				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				144,
				1
			],
			"Message": "docs(Air): Add 50-level deep analysis audit template to Library\n\nThis commit adds a comprehensive 50-level audit framework to the Air daemon's Library.rs, creating a self-documenting analysis system directly in the source code.\n\nThe audit template covers:\n- **Level 1-10**: Basic structure verification (Cargo.toml, source structure, modules, CI, tests)\n- **Level 11-20**: Module analysis (ApplicationState, Authentication, Binary, CLI, Configuration, etc.)\n- **Level 21-30**: Code quality checks (unused imports, dead code, naming, error handling, async patterns)\n- **Level 31-40**: Convention verification (PascalCase, snake_case, struct/enum/function naming, visibility)\n- **Level 41-50**: Refactoring opportunities (code duplication, DRY, SOLID, performance, security)\n\nKey findings documented:\n- Type: Rust-based Element in the Land monorepo\n- Current status: 99 TODOs found in the codebase\n- Last commit changes tracked: Plural→singular field naming (NC-01 to NC-04)\n\nThis inline audit system allows developers to track analysis progress directly in the source file, providing visibility into the current state of Air's quality assurance process without requiring external documentation.",
